('APX-C-2408', '2408', 'Handheld Shoulder-mounted Camera', 'Handheld shoulder-mounted camera, natural shake, slight autofocus breathing, no stabilization. Opening frame: a quiet residential street in late afternoon, soft golden sunlight, long shadows across parked cars. Ambient sound: distant traffic, wind, faint birds.', null, null, 'https://x.com/LudovicCreator/status/2039043824907935790', 'Handheld shoulder-mounted camera, natural shake, slight autofocus breathing, no stabilization.

