Camera slowly pushes through floating debris (still partially in slow motion).
The cat lands in real time.
Looks directly into lens, slight head tilt, playful grin.

Line (sharp, confident):
“follow cat master for more fluffy chaos.”

Freeze frame → sudden glitch zoom → retro punch sound.', null, null, 'missing', 6, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, 'high-fps-slowmo', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@drjoetw', 'https://x.com/drjoetw', null, null),
