('APX-C-2365', '2365', 'Core Scene', 'Core scene: A candlelit dinner at a high-end restaurant where the husband presents his wife with custom luxury noise-canceling headphones. The wife is moved to tears, culminating in the romantic moment of her putting them on. Scene 1 (0-1s) ✨ Atmosphere setup.', 7, null, 'https://x.com/yangqing_66/status/2038592529764094086', 'Core scene: A candlelit dinner at a high-end restaurant where the husband presents his wife with custom luxury noise-canceling headphones. The wife is moved to tears, culminating in the romantic moment of her putting them on. Scene 1 (0-1s) ✨ Atmosphere setup. Visuals: Overhead shot of the entire high-end restaurant, warm yellow candlelight flickering, soft light refracted by crystal glasses, exquisite French cuisine on a black velvet tablecloth. The wife, wearing a velvet dress, is looking down cutting steak. The husband gazes at her tenderly, his fingertips stroking the velvet gift box. Sound effects: Soft jazz BGM in the restaurant, the faint sound of cutlery touching the porcelain plate. Dialogue: Husband (low and gentle): “My dear, you’ve worked hard today.” Scene 2 (2-3s) 🎧 Surprise reveal. Visuals: Close-up of the husband slowly pushing the velvet gift box over. The wife looks up, stunned, her eyelashes fluttering. The husband opens the box lid, revealing custom luxury headphones (metallic texture + engraved details) glowing with a cold, high-end light in the candlelight. Sound effects: BGM fades, the soft sound of the box opening, the wife''s sharp intake of breath. Dialogue: Wife (choked up): “Is this…?” Husband: “You always said it was noisy wearing headphones while working overtime. With these, you’ll only hear my voice.” Scene 3 (4-5s) 😭 Emotional climax. Visuals: Close-up shot of the wife''s face, tears streaming down her cheeks. She raises her hand to cover her mouth, her eyes filled with surprise and emotion. The husband gently wipes away her tears. Sound effects: BGM rises in pitch, adding 