dtrack uses light guitar plucking in the past scenes. It mutes upon entering the present scene, leaving only the sound of rain. After the last line of dialogue, a deep cello single string starts playing. Complete silence before the fade to black.', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'stylized-real', 'cold-blue', '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: venue, handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@johnAGI168', 'https://x.com/johnAGI168', null, null),
