('APX-C-2147', '2147', 'Shot on ALEXA 65Mm Anamorphic Lens', 'Shot on ALEXA 65mm lens. cinematic quality. Aspect ratio 2.39:1 widescreen. Teal shadows, warm amber highlights.. Tokyo neon dusk. Lens flares, motion blur. Dolby Vision.', null, '2.39:1', 'https://x.com/ZaraIrahh/status/2037465091994767370', 'Shot on ALEXA 65mm anamorphic lens. Photorealistic cinematic quality. Aspect ratio 2.39:1 widescreen. Teal shadows, warm amber highlights. Film grain. Tokyo neon dusk. Lens flares, motion blur. Dolby Vision HDR.

0.0s–2.5s:

