('APX-C-2152', '2152', 'Super-fast FPV Shot on the Back of a Butterfly', 'A super-fast FPV shot on the back of a butterfly, taken from the point of view of a butterfly flying over a chaotic picnic in a public park. The camera flies over red-checked blankets, dodges between soda cans, plastic cups, fingers grabbing chips, and splashes of ketchup.', null, null, 'https://x.com/ZaraIrahh/status/2037363916087644563', 'A super-fast FPV shot on the back of a butterfly, taken from the point of view of a butterfly flying over a chaotic picnic in a public park. The camera flies over red-checked blankets, dodges between soda cans, plastic cups, fingers grabbing chips, and splashes of ketchup. The camera dips into a slice of watermelon. juice splashes in slow motion. He walks through a tunnel of paper plates, skirting a laughing child as he takes a bite. The camera slides over the dog''s snapping jaws, flits between bubbles floating in the sun, and eventually sinks into a Coca-Cola can with a hiss. An absolute sense of scale, sweetness, noise, chaos, pure butterfly adrenaline.', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'direct', 'stylized-real', null, 'high-fps-slowmo', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: beverage, real place', 'seedance_2.0', '@ZaraIrahh', 'https://x.com/ZaraIrahh', null, null),
('APX-C-2160', '2160', 'Character: a Female Haute Couture Tailor', 'Character: A female haute couture tailor with an extremely capable physique and arm muscles like steel wires, with eyes as cold as a needle tip.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/Adam38363368936/status/2037359552849666514', 'SUBJECTS:
Character: A female haute couture tailor with an extremely capable physique and arm muscles like steel wires, with eyes as cold as a needle tip.
Attire: A dark tactical vest incorporating cheongsam elements, bare arms, forearms wrapped with dark red silk wrist guards (to increase friction); long, slender fingers with metal finger guards. 
Action Style: Blending the ''inch power'' of Wing Chun with the ''circular rotation'' of Tai Chi. Actions follow the rhythm of (power accumulation → rapid strike → instantaneous stillness), emphasizing the explosive power of the fingers and the tension of the silk in the air.

ENVIRONMENT:
A dimly lit, high-end private studio. The background is a wall of mahogany thread spools, with thousands of color blocks forming a geometric aesthetic; the center features a huge black marble cutting table with a highly reflective surface. A single-point focused industrial cold light hangs above, and fine fiber particles float in the air.

MOOD:
Extremely focused, deadly serious, ritualistic grandeur; movements as precise as a surgeon, visually oppressive.

TIMELINE:
0:00-0:02: Close-up/Wide-angle POV. The tailor rests her hands on the black marble table, head bowed and still. The camera rapidly pushes in, she suddenly raises her head, locking eyes with the camera (a killing gaze). She grabs at the void with her right hand, and a piece of dark purple heavy silk slides across the table like a long snake, which she ''locks'' with one hand.

0:02-0:05: Cut transition/Handheld feel. The tailor tosses the silk into the air. Her figure is a blur, holding long silver shears in her right hand, performing a ''blind cut'' the moment the silk falls. This is not an ordinary cut, but one accompanied by the force of a martial arts punch. The scissors cut through the air with a ''hiss,'' and the fabric edge is perfectly straight and neat.
0:05-0:07: Moving shot. She slides to the other end of the workbench with a side step. With a single sweep of her hand, several steel needles shake off the pin cushion and hover in mid-air. She pushes them with force, and the needles accurately embed themselves like hidden weapons into the distant mannequin, the needle tails vibrating, emitting a metallic chime.

0:07-0:10: Continuous shot. The tailor begins ''thread control.'' She pulls out a gold thread, which, through the winding between her fingers, controls the silk to automatically fold and form in the air, like manipulating a puppet string. Each flick of her finger is accompanied by spark-like static electricity. She bumps the table with her elbow, the presser foot springs up, and she instantly catches and locks it onto the fabric.

0:10-0:12: Match cut. The tailor performs a rapid pivot in place, and the hem of her outer garment spreads out in a circle. She brings her hands together, sharply pulling the formed suit collar, and the final gold thread draws a perfect arc in the air, automatically stitching the seam. The action transitions from extremely fast (afterimage) to instantaneous extreme slow motion (freeze frame).

0:12-0:15: Stable POV. The dust settles. She lifts the finished gown with one hand and shakes it vigorously, unfolding the gown in front of the camera. The lens focuses on the exquisite embroidery of the collar. She lightly taps a button with her fingernail—the button trembles. She then turns and walks into the shadow, leaving a silhouette, and the screen is completely covered by rising expensive perfume mist, fading out cleanly.', null, null, 'missing', 6, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, 'high-fps-slowmo', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: fashion, handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@Adam38363368936', 'https://x.com/Adam38363368936', null, null),
('APX-C-2166', '2166', 'Scene (0-5 Seconds)', 'Scene (0-5 seconds): Close-up of the female lead tearing up the contract, paper scraps floating down. The CEO kneels on one knee, reaching out to stop her, his eyes panicked. The female lead turns away, a cold smile on her lips. Dialogue 1 (CEO, humble and panicked): Su Wan!', 15, null, 'https://x.com/ChangningL29508/status/2037341685257048230', 'Scene (0-5 seconds): Close-up of the female lead tearing up the contract, paper scraps floating down. The CEO kneels on one knee, reaching out to stop her, his eyes panicked. The female lead turns away, a cold smile on her lips. Dialogue 1 (CEO, humble and panicked): Su Wan! The contract isn''t over, you can''t leave! I''ll give you money, I''ll give you status! Scene (6-10 seconds): The female lead lifts her foot to avoid his hand, throwing the shredded contract paper onto his face. The camera pans over the surrounding guests whispering. Dialogue 2 (Female Lead, cold counter-attack): Contract? Mr. Gu, you were the one who said I wasn''t even worthy to carry your shoes. Now you''re begging me? Too late! Scene (11-15 seconds): The CEO freezes in place, paper scraps clinging to his face. The female lead turns and walks away proudly, the hem of her red dress flowing. Sound Effects: Luxurious yet tense background music, the sound of the contract tearing, faint whispers from the guests. Duration: Exactly 15 seconds.', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: fashion', 'seedance_2.0', '@ChangningL29508', 'https://x.com/ChangningL29508', null, null),
