('APX-S-2408-1', 'APX-C-2408', 1, null, null, null, 'Handheld shoulder-mounted camera, natural shake, slight autofocus breathing, no stabilization. Opening frame: a quiet residential street in late afternoon, soft golden sunlight, long shadows across parked cars. Ambient sound: distant traffic, wind, faint birds.', null, null, 'Shoulder-mounted camera, natural shake, slight autofocus breathing, no stabilization. Opening frame: a quiet residential street in late afternoon, soft golden sunlight, long shadows across parked cars.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2408-2', 'APX-C-2408', 2, null, null, null, 'The camera slowly walks forward along the sidewalk. At the 2-second mark, a black SUV suddenly enters frame at high speed from the left — tires screeching, suspension compressing unevenly as it loses control. The vehicle clips a parked red sedan — the impact is abrupt and messy, metal folding naturally, glass shattering outward in uneven fragments.', null, null, 'The camera slowly walks forward along the sidewalk.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2408-3', 'APX-C-2408', 3, null, null, null, 'No slow motion — everything happens in real time. The red car is pushed violently onto the curb, its front end crumpling with realistic deformation. Airbags deploy with a muffled pop. The camera operator instinctively steps back — slight stumble, frame dips, then recovers.', null, null, 'The camera operator instinctively steps back — slight stumble, frame dips, then recovers.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2408-4', 'APX-C-2408', 4, null, null, null, 'Smoke begins to rise from the SUV’s engine bay. Sound design: raw — crunch of metal, tire friction, glass, no cinematic exaggeration. Final frame: both cars at rest, subtle ticking sounds, no dramatic music. Style: documentary realism, imperfect framing, natural lighting, no visual effects, 4K.', null, null, 'Smoke begins to rise from the SUV’s engine bay. Final frame: both cars at rest, subtle ticking sounds, no dramatic music.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2434-1', 'APX-C-2434', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 229, 'Explode your creativity and express a Music Video that no one in this world has ever seen, condensed into 15 seconds.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2434-2', 'APX-C-2434', 2, null, null, null, null, 231, 161, 'Whether it''s multi-cut or a single long take is known only to God. An artistic 15-second MV influenced by Fauvist and Surrealist artists that excites the viewer.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2417-1', 'APX-C-2417', 1, null, null, null, 'Concept: A man sees a spider on the wall. He responds with the intensity of a home invasion. Characters: Dave, a large, muscular man in a bathrobe. Escalation: He rolls behind the couch like it''s cover fire. Army-crawls to the kitchen for a shoe.', null, null, 'Concept: A man sees a spider on the wall. He responds with the intensity of a home invasion. Escalation: He rolls behind the couch like it''s cover fire.', null, null, null, null, 'kitchen', null),
('APX-S-2417-2', 'APX-C-2417', 2, null, null, null, 'Returns in a tactical crouch with oven mitts as armor. The spider moves one inch, Dave screams and throws the shoe through the TV. He duct-tapes himself into a protective suit. Pulls out a leaf blower. Visual Punchline: His tiny daughter walks in, picks up the spider bare-handed, puts it outsidethe house, and gives him a disappointed look.', null, null, 'He duct-tapes himself into a protective suit. Visual Punchline: His tiny daughter walks, picks up the spider bare-handed, puts it outsidethe house, and gives him a disappointed look.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2407-1', 'APX-C-2407', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 241, 'A mist-covered bamboo forest at dusk with deep jade-green ambient light and silver moonlight filtering through dense leaves.', null, null, null, null, 'forest', null),
('APX-S-2407-2', 'APX-C-2407', 2, null, null, null, 'Wind pushes the bamboo stalks in rhythmic waves. **Action:** 15.0s sequence. A massive white tiger with luminous blue markings along its fur stalks through the bamboo forest while a colossal black panther with glowing amber eyes circles in the shadows.', null, null, 'Wind pushes the bamboo stalks in rhythmic waves. A massive white tiger with luminous blue markings along its fur stalks through the bamboo forest while a colossal black panther with glowing amber eyes circles in the shadows.', null, null, null, null, 'forest', null),
('APX-S-2407-3', 'APX-C-2407', 3, null, null, null, 'They engage in rapid, low-to-the-ground combat across wet forest terrain. Every leap sends arcs of water spraying from the ground while claws carve glowing trails through the rain. Velocity Ramp choreography: the tiger’s mid-air pounce slows to ultra-slow motion as both animals collide, fur and water droplets suspended in the air before snapping back to full speed as they crash through bamboo stalks. **Camera:** Handheld ground-level tracking through the bamboo forest, occasionally catching the fight reflected in rain puddles before snapping focus back to the animals as they burst through the foliage. **Style & Constraints:** Photorealistic fur simulation, volumetric rain particles, ray-traced reflections on wet ground, cinematic moonlight, 35mm film grain, stable geometry, 8K.', null, null, 'They engage in rapid, low-to-the-ground combat across wet forest terrain. Velocity Ramp choreography: the tiger’s mid-air pounce slows to ultra- as both animals collide, fur and water droplets suspended in the air before snapping back to…', null, 'leaping', null, null, 'forest', null),
