('APX-S-2143-1', 'APX-C-2143', 1, null, null, null, 'English: Handheld-cinema feel, ultra-detailed 4-second text-to-video prompt, 4K, 120fps, ultra-high resolution, realistic live-action concert footage. Outdoor daytime concert on an extremely hot, bright, sunlit day. An Asian K-pop girl group is performing on stage. The camera starts from within the crowd, partially blocked by cheering audience members, raised hands, lightsticks, and phones, then smoothly pushes forward and zooms in to focus on one woman in the group. She is the clear subject, center-frame by the end. She is an adult woman, very charming, cute, and charismatic, with glamorous makeup, glossy full lips, clipped hair, and long delicate manicured nails.', null, null, 'The camera starts from within the crowd, partially blocked by cheering audience members, raised hands, lightsticks, and phones, then smoothly pushes forward and to focus on one woman in the group.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2143-2', 'APX-C-2143', 2, null, null, null, 'She wears a light pink tight crop top, a thick oversized cropped hoodie, and low-rise detailed jeans with visible string-thong styling. Slim waist, very slender midriff, natural soft figure. Sweat glow on skin from the hot weather, sunlight reflecting on her face and outfit, vivid stage atmosphere, energetic crowd, realistic lens breathing, natural camera shake, shallow depth of field, high dynamic range, crisp skin texture, fabric texture, cinematic highlights, vivid summer colors. Action timing: the song ends, the crowd roars, she notices the camera, sends a very flirtatious kiss toward the lens, then immediately becomes shy and smiles with a bashful expression, slightly lowering her gaze and shoulders in a sweet, lovable way.', null, null, 'She wears a light pink tight crop top, a thick oversized cropped hoodie, and low-rise detailed jeans with visible string-thong styling.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2143-3', 'APX-C-2143', 3, null, null, null, 'The motion should feel natural, confident, playful, and endearing. Emphasize realistic facial micro-expressions, subtle body movement, crowd perspective, immersive handheld zoom-in, and high-end concert cinematography. Chinese: Handheld shooting texture, ultra-detailed 4-second text-to-video prompt, 4K, 120fps, ultra-high resolution, realistic live-action concert footage. Outdoor daytime concert, the weather is very hot, the sun is strong and bright. An Asian K-pop girl group is performing on stage. The camera starts from within the crowd, partially blocked by cheering audience members, raised hands, lightsticks, and phones, then smoothly pushes forward and gradually zooms in, eventually focusing on one adult woman in the girl group, who is centered in the frame by the end.', null, null, 'The camera starts from within the crowd, partially blocked by cheering audience members, raised hands, lightsticks, and phones, then smoothly pushes forward and gradually, eventually focusing on one adult woman in the girl group, who is…', null, null, null, null, null, 'playful'),
